invalid type: string "---\n\n### Section 5: Imputation Method Selection Advice\n\n**When to use 'knn' (K-Nearest Neighbors):**\n- **Best for**: Datasets where data points that are \"close\" to each other are similar. Excellent for sensor data or spatial data. It's computationally faster than MICE or GP.\nsary: `df.replace([np.inf, -np.inf], np.nan, inplace=True)`.\n\n---\n\nng. Try removing them."